<title>POLAND: ZREW Q2 net rises to PLN 1.7 mln.</title>
<headline>ZREW Q2 net rises to PLN 1.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ZREW SA preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
